{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates","id":1111206,"title":"Placing the Tyrannates","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-04T04:57:02-07:00","id":1111206,"title":"Placing the Tyrannates","content":"So, I've been working on something as a side project apart from the Mage Chronicles I'm getting ready to run. I've been trying to detail the upper echelons of the Great Ministries of the Seers of the Throne, including the Ministers and some of their Secretaries. Now, one of the things that I'm trying to figure out is where the 'Seed' locations of the Tyrannates are, which would also presumably house the primary Irises into the realms.<br /> <br /> The Hegemonic Ministry: The Palace of Westminster? Versailles?<br /> <br /> The Praetorian Ministry: Babylon? Somewhere in Rome?<br /> <br /> The Ministry of Paternoster: The Vatican? The Dome of the Rock? Somewhere in Constantinople?<br /> <br /> The Ministry of Panopticon: I draw a blank here.<br /> <br /> I was also thinking about whether the Ministry of Mammon would have a Tyrannate, or some other type of headquarters, but I was unsure. Anyone have any other ideas? And has anyone else used the Tyrannates in their Chronicles?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T05:11:13-07:00","id":1111210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates#post1111206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was also thinking about whether the Ministry of Mammon would have a Tyrannate, or some other type of headquarters, but I was unsure. Anyone have any other ideas? And has anyone else used the Tyrannates in their Chronicles?</div> </div> </div> </div>Obviously Wall Street.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3648-nepher","name":"Nepher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3648_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T05:32:30-07:00","id":1111213,"title":"","content":"Panopticon's whole thing is that they're always everywhere, so maybe their HQ is somewhere unexpected and remote - a sleepy village in Spain, the Mongolian desert, the Himalayas.<br /> <br /> Alternatively there are plenty of locations associated with surveillance - Moscow, Pyongyang, Fort Meade (NSA headquarters).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13628-terrorforge","name":"Terrorforge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"185"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T07:05:38-07:00","id":1111247,"title":"","content":"The Panopticon Tyrannate is described in Imperial Mysteries; it's a literal Panopticon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T07:36:43-07:00","id":1111259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates?p=1111247#post1111247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Panopticon Tyrannate is described in Imperial Mysteries; it's a literal Panopticon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh, reading it now. Interesting-...<br /> <br /> There are a lot of prisons which actually were built in the Panopticon style-... Could potentially work as the Presidio Modelo in Cuba?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T13:25:08-07:00","id":1111393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates#post1111206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Ministry of Panopticon: I draw a blank here.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that they are supposed to have a fairly justified reputation for being everywhere and seeing everything. <br /> That being said the nerve centers of massive surveillance organizations like MI6, NSA, Facebook, Google, or Microsoft would be strong contenders.<br /> <br /> I am sorry, did I imply some of the things we love and opt into are tools that enslave us? Yup.<br /> <br /> Also with the amount of mastery of the Space Arcanum near the top of that particular side of the pyramid, it seems silly it'd be one earthly location and not a Quarantine Pocket realm leading to various n\u00e8rve centers to optimize coverage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 07-04-2017, 04:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T21:30:06-07:00","id":1111549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nepher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates?p=1111210#post1111210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Obviously Wall Street.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or somewhere else.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/SYOA4tS.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> A brief glimpse of the hows and whys is <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/6TKQy\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. The comic is basically about the Ministry of Mammon and a Sleepwalker detective, who may be more, vaguely stumbling onto some of its conspiracies while there's a vying for power and vengeance high up in the top.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-05-2017, 01:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T02:35:32-07:00","id":1111594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates?p=1111393#post1111393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also with the amount of mastery of the Space Arcanum near the top of that particular side of the pyramid, it seems silly it'd be one earthly location and not a Quarantine Pocket realm leading to various n\u00e8rve centers to optimize coverage.</div> </div> </div> </div>To clarify a little, that's essentially what a Tyrannate is, it's a special kind of chantry. However, to make one the archmaster needs a 'seed' location, basically a template to go off, that's what Kleptomania is looking for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T10:28:12-07:00","id":1111702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates?p=1111594#post1111594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...chantry...</div> </div> </div> </div>Right because Seer Ministries are run by Archmages and Archmages have Chantries with Golden Roads to various places and realms, I totally spaced on that particular implication of allowing an Archmage be the Minister. My apologies.<br /> <br /> If that case you'll want to find the best location that that matches the historical context of the current Minister rise to be the head of the Ministry. ie. It'd be NPC based, who is the current Panopticon Minister? May I strongly recommend someone with Fame instead of Occultation. If it were my Chronicle I'd have social media or software operating system giants as the pylon for the current Minister, having out maneuvered the NSA/MI6 pylon's Minister. I'd favor Bill Gates or Mark Zuckerberg type people, and choose from there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T12:17:19-07:00","id":1111770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates?p=1111702#post1111702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right because Seer Ministries are run by Archmages and Archmages have Chantries with Golden Roads to various places and realms, I totally spaced on that particular implication of allowing an Archmage be the Minister. My apologies.<br /> <br /> If that case you'll want to find the best location that that matches the historical context of the current Minister rise to be the head of the Ministry. ie. It'd be NPC based, who is the current Panopticon Minister? May I strongly recommend someone with Fame instead of Occultation. If it were my Chronicle I'd have social media or software operating system giants as the pylon for the current Minister, having out maneuvered the NSA/MI6 pylon's Minister. I'd favor Bill Gates or Mark Zuckerberg type people, and choose from there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bad thinking - Tyrannates are INHERITED - Minsters are weird in Archmages lot that they are given 'job position' after previous one. They may add some things to stuff in Tyrannate as it is, but most of the realm will be left overs from generations of predecessors influnace on position.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T15:04:49-07:00","id":1111827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1111206-placing-the-tyrannates?p=1111770#post1111770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bad thinking - Tyrannates are INHERITED - Minsters are weird in Archmages lot that they are given 'job position' after previous one. They may add some things to stuff in Tyrannate as it is, but most of the realm will be left overs from generations of predecessors influnace on position.</div> </div> </div> </div>So even if Bill Gates in his Pylon with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZkzpcfY9JAo\" target=\"_blank\">Mark Zuckerberg, Tom Anderson, Sergey Brin, Larry Page</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSl7GYVn4Kc\" target=\"_blank\">Sumner Redstone</a> was the current Minister, it'd have chambers with Spirit-awakened old MI6/CIA/NSA computers and Goetia Fetishes of terrifying intelligence due to Spirit and Mind magic that reaches into all those secret government databases which have a fraction of the information freely given to social media, and search engines? &quot;Old relics&quot; of a bygone era, as it were, humming along in the &quot;basement bunker&quot; (very Cold War, with the rise of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mass_surveillance\" target=\"_blank\">Surveillance State</a>*.), and the shiny new hardware on the upper floors of something like a corporate skyscraper with windows that let you look out anywhere in the world? In my chronicles, I have Sumner Redstone start as the head of the Pylon to later be eclipsed by Bill Gates rise to Archemage of Space, making the world a smaller and less private place.<br /> <br /> *ok to be fair that's more current and made possible because of the digital revolution by the aforementioned Seer of the Throne pioneers. This is a link with less hyperbole**: <a href=\"http://www.storypick.com/intelligence-agencies/\" target=\"_blank\">10 most powerful Intelligence Agencies</a>.<br /> <br /> **Your subjective meter of hyperbole mileage may vary<br /> <br /> &quot;Bad thinking&quot; indeed... <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/CBS_logo.svg/260px-CBS_logo.svg.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 07-06-2017, 09:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}